.SH EXAMPLES
One vulnerable\->fixed pair per ecosystem (Node.js).
.SS Node.js
\fIVulnerable:\fR
.RS
.EX
app.post('/upload', (req, res) => { /* no body-size limit -> DoS */ });
.EE
.RE
\fIFixed:\fR
.RS
.EX
app.use(express.json({ limit: '100kb' }));   // cap request size
.EE
.RE
